  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tBookkeeping\n\t\tBookkeeping FAQs\n\n### Is it possible to add receipts for a number of invoices at once without doing them individually.\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 25 Oct, 2021 at  2:28 PM\n\n\t\tYou may add receipts for a number of invoices only for the particular customer under \n\nClick here to watch how to add multiple receipts in one go\n\nNavigation: Bookkeeping>> Select Client>>Sales>>Receipts>>+ Receipt. \n\nYou can then add receipt details in as necessary\n\nPlease then click save\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115344\">Bookkeeping</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188520\">Bookkeeping FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Is it possible to add receipts for a number of invoices at once without doing them individually.\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Mon, 25 Oct, 2021 at  2:28 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">You may add receipts for a number of invoices only for the particular customer under&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"http://ow%20to%20add%20multiple%20receipts%20for%20multiple%20invoices%20in%20one%20go\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Click here to watch how to add multiple receipts in one go</span></strong></a></p><p><br></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Navigation:&nbsp;</strong>Bookkeeping&gt;&gt; Select Client&gt;&gt;Sales&gt;&gt;Receipts&gt;&gt;+ Receipt.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9142761234/original/ADYpgG-AetyqjEsFWBW1SLj6D5Q1WR0-2g.png?1635168425\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9142761234\"></span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">You can then add receipt details in as necessary</p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9142761298/original/8xUkKirX8twm2pBowKoH1KZ329Osv5Ge4g.png?1635168462\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9142761298\"></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Please then click save</p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165294\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165294/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165294\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165294/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165294\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a class=\"hide a-link\" id=\"vote-feedback-form-link\" data-hide-dom=\"#vote-feedback-form-link\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">Send feedback</a><div id=\"vote-feedback-container\"class=\"hide\">\t<div class=\"lead\">Sorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.</div>\t<div id=\"vote-feedback-form\">\t\t<div class=\"sload